# Calendar Event
{
  "id": str,
  "title": str,
  "start": str: ISO 8601,
  "end": str: ISO 8601,   2026-07-25T15:00:00-04:00
  "location": str
  "category": str
  "descr": str
}
# Calendar Event format from frontend
  "id": str,
  "title": str,
  "startdate": str: YYYY-MM-DD,
  "enddate": str: YYYY-MM-DD,
  "starttime": str: HH:MM (24h)
  "endtime": str: HH:MM (24h)
  "location": str
  "category": str
  "descr": str

Notes:
- id is unique.
- start, end, location may be empty and all info is contained in title, fields will be filled out later automatically


fullcalendar event structure
{
    id: "event-123",
    title: "Doctor appointment",
    start: "2026-07-26T15:00:00",
    end: "2026-07-26T16:00:00",
    allDay: false,
    extendedProps: {
        location?: "Toronto",
        description?: "Bring documents"
    }
}
